      <Docs>
        <param name="iterations">number of times the effect should be played.</param>
        <summary>Number of times that the effect should be played in a loop.</summary>
        <returns>To be added.</returns>
        <remarks>
          <para>Number of times that the effect should be played in a loop.</para>
          <para>By default, the builder configures this value to 1 for a single run of the effect.</para>
          <para>A value of 0 indicates the effect should repeat indefinitely until a new effect or state is provided for the light or until the light is turned off.</para>
          <para>If the effect has an initial state (delay = 0 for the first control point) the initial state will only be applied during the first iteration and all other iterations will ignore the initial value.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/hardware/lights/MultiLightEffect.Builder#setIterations(int)" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.hardware.lights.MultiLightEffect.Builder.setIterations</code>.</a></format></para>
